{"id":"word:hebrew:H5867","type":"word","title":"עֵילָם","subtitle":"H5867 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Elam , a son of Shem and his descendants, with their country; also of six Israelites","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עֵילָם (H5867) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-m n-pr-loc.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 30 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עֵילָם (ʻÊylâm) means Elam , a son of Shem and his descendants, with their country; also of six Israelites First listed occurrence: 1Chr 1 17."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עֵילָם","transliteration":"ʻÊylâm","pronunciation":"ay-lawm'","strong":"H5867","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5867","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-m n-pr-loc","forms":["עֵילָ֔ם","עֵילָ֣ם","עֵילָם֙","עֵילָ֑ם","עולם"],"morphs":[["HNp",22],["HC/Np",3],["HR/Np",2],["HNcmsa",2],["HC/R/Np",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"Elam , a son of Shem and his descendants, with their country; also of six Israelites","usage":"Elam.","full":"H5867. Eylam I. עֵילָם proper name, of a people et. terr. Elam , Αιλαμ , Ἐλαμεῖραι , well-known country and people northeast of Lower Tigris (Assyrian Elamtu Dl Pa 320 ff. COT Gen 10:22 ); — as early invaders of Palestine 14:1 , 9 , allies of Assyr. Isa 22:6 ; foe of Babylon 21:2 ; abode of dispersed Israelites 11:11 ; prophesied against Jer 49:34-35 , 36 (twice in verse) (Qr, Kt עולם ), 49:37 ; 49:38 ; 49:39 ; Ezek 32:24 , compare ע ׳כָּלמַֿלְכֵי Jer 25:25 ; called 'son' of Shem Gen 10:22 (P) = 1Chr 1:17 ; purely local designation ׳ע הַמְּדִינָה Dan 8:2 . II. עֵילָם proper name, masculine Ηλαμ , Αιλαμ : 1 heads of families of returned exiles: a. Ezra 2:7 = Neh 7:12 . b. Ezra 2:31 = Neh 7:34 . c. Ezra 8:7 ; 10:2 (Qr; Kt עולם ), 10:26 . 2. a chief of people Neh 10:15 . 3 name in Benjamin 1Chr 8:24 . 4 Levite name 1Chr 26:3 . 5 a priest Neh 12:42 .","rootNote":"or עוֹלָם ; (Ezra 10:2; Jeremiah 49:36), probably from 5956 ; hidden, i.e. distant;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 1 17","keyReferences":["1Chr 1 17","1Chr 8 24","1Chr 26 3","Dan 8 2","Ezek 32 24","Ezra 2 7","Ezra 2 31","Ezra 8 7"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":30,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 1 17","book":"1Chr","chapter":1,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵילָ֣ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 8 24","book":"1Chr","chapter":8,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/עֵילָ֖ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Chr 26 3","book":"1Chr","chapter":26,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵילָ֤ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Dan 8 2","book":"Dan","chapter":8,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/עֵילָ֣ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"Ezek 32 24","book":"Ezek","chapter":32,"verse":24,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵילָם֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezra 2 7","book":"Ezra","chapter":2,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵילָ֔ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezra 2 31","book":"Ezra","chapter":2,"verse":31,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵילָ֣ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezra 8 7","book":"Ezra","chapter":8,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵילָ֔ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezra 10 2","book":"Ezra","chapter":10,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עולם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezra 10 2","book":"Ezra","chapter":10,"verse":2,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵילָם֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Ezra 10 26","book":"Ezra","chapter":10,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵילָ֑ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Gen 10 22","book":"Gen","chapter":10,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֵילָ֣ם","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"Gen 14 1","book"